<title>INDONESIA: BADMINTON-WORLD GRAND PRIX FINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-WORLD GRAND PRIX FINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TEMBAU DENPASAR, Bali 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals at the World Grand Prix Finals on Sunday:</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Michael Sogaard/Rikke Olsen (Denmark) beat Trikus Heryanto/Minarti Timur (Indonesia) 15-10 15-11</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>Ge Fei/Gu Jun (China) beat Eliza/Rosiana Zelin (Indonesia) 15-4 15-4  </p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Fung Permadi (Taiwan) beat Sun Jun (China) 15-12 15-8</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Susi Susanti (Indonesia) beat Ye Zhaoying (China) 11-4 11-1</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Ricky Subagja/Rexy Mainaky (Indonesia) beat Cheah Soon Kit/Yap Him Hock (Malaysia) 15-4 15-9.</p>
</text>
